    <string name="eraser_help">Hold the pen’s side button to erase while it is held; the eraser end of a pen erases too.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_pen">Pressure-sensitive, crisp ballpoint pen.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_wet">Starts glossy and raised, dries in a few seconds.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_wave">A 3D sea seen from above, with waves and plays of light inside.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_highlighter">Colors under the text without covering it.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_pencil">Paper-textured graphite. Tilt the pen to shade wide and soft.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_calligraphy">Flat nib: thins and thickens with direction.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_watercolor">Transparent paint blots that darken at the edges.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_neon">A glowing light tube.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_rainbow">Changes color as you draw.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_glitter">Glitter that sparkles in the light.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_grass">Short 3D grass grows, readable even in small writing. Flowers bloom after 1–2 seconds.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_sea">A sea flowing along the line: turquoise shallows, nets of light gliding under the water, waves foaming on both shores.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_lava">Flowing, glowing lava. It cools in a few seconds while embers keep burning in its cracks.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_fountain">Raised, glossy fountain pen ink. Press harder and the nib opens, the line thickens.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_gold">Embossed metal that reflects the light: gold, silver, copper.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_chrome">Mirror-like liquid metal that reflects the sky.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_ice">Clear, frosted ice with cracks and sparkles inside.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_jelly">Light-catching, gently wobbling candy jelly.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_galaxy">Space with drifting nebulae and twinkling stars.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_lightning">A crackling, glowing electric arc.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_pearl">Pearls with a mother-of-pearl shimmer strung along the line.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_impasto">Thick, raised oil paint with visible brush strokes.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_bloom">A glossy turquoise water line. When you lift the pen, glassy blue and violet flowers open on it.</string>

